<title>BAHRAIN: Al-Bank Al-Saudi Al-Fransi lifts Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Al-Bank Al-Saudi Al-Fransi lifts Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			    (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		 102.9    vs     92.4</p>
<p> Operating income	 510.8    vs    490.6</p>
<p> Operating expenses     413.3    vs    398.9</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  2,766.5    vs  2,653.1</p>
<p> Assets		  28,720.6    vs 27,313.3</p>
<p>Full Name: Al-Bank Al-Saudi Al-Fransi, also known as Saudi French Bank.</p>
<p>Note - Paris-based Banque Indosuez, the banking arm of Compagnie de Suez, owns 31.1 percent in the Riyadh-based bank.</p>
</text>
